Package: hocmesh
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Conflicts: hoc-mesh-desktop
Replaces: hoc-mesh-desktop
Maintainer: hocMESH Contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/codedev-david/hocmesh
Description: hocMESH distributed AI compute peer
 A whole hocMESH peer for a machine with no screen: node, coordinator and
 validator. It serves -- lending CPU, memory and GPU to other people's work --
 and it spends what that earns on work of its own. Install hoc-mesh-desktop
 instead on a machine with a display; it is the same peer with a window.
